#: appPlugins/ToolGcodeSender/SenderToolChangeUI.py:24
msgid ""
"Fixed touchplate:\n"
"1. Install the reference tool and set the board Z datum as usual.\n"
"2. Jog the spindle above the fixed plate.\n"
"3. Press 'Calibrate fixed plate'.\n"
"4. After a tool change, jog above the same plate and press 'Measure "
